<title>OMAN: Oman real GDP rises 4.6 pct in 1995, 3.8 pct 1994.</title>
<headline>Oman real GDP rises 4.6 pct in 1995, 3.8 pct 1994.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's real Gross Domestic Product rose 4.6 percent in 1995 compared to 3.8 percent the previous year.</p>
<p>Following figures were issued by the Central Bank in a report carried by the official Omani news agency.</p>
<p>Percentage change over one year:</p>
<p>					   1995		 1994</p>
<p> Real GDP				 4.6		  3.8</p>
<p> GDP at current prices (prel)     6.5		  3.4</p>
</text>
